@startuml sequence_agentic_rag
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

title Sequence Diagram: Conversational Agentic RAG Workflow

actor User as "Researcher"
participant SPA as "React Client (Chat UI)"
participant BFF as "Node.js API Gateway"
participant AI as "FastAPI AI Engine"
participant Planner as "Planner Agent"
participant Retriever as "Retriever Agent (ChromaDB)"
participant Execution as "Specialist Agents (Grammar/Citation/Plagiarism)"
participant Synthesis as "Synthesis Agent"

User -> SPA: 1. Types prompt ("Analyze literature gap in methodology")
SPA -> BFF: 2. POST /api/v1/chat/completions (Stream: true, JWT)
BFF -> BFF: 3. Verify JWT & Apply Token Bucket Rate Limit
BFF -> AI: 4. POST /internal/v1/agent/query (mTLS / Internal Key)

AI -> Planner: 5. Invoke with User Prompt & Document State
Planner -> Planner: 6. Classify intent & construct execution DAG
Planner -> Retriever: 7. Execute Hybrid Retrieval (Vector + BM25)
Retriever -> Retriever: 8. Query ChromaDB with tenant filter
Retriever --> Planner: 9. Top-K relevant academic excerpts

Planner -> Execution: 10. Dispatch domain tasks (e.g. check citation consistency)
Execution --> Planner: 11. Analysis outputs & critique artifacts

Planner -> Synthesis: 12. Synthesize context, citations & response
activate Synthesis
Synthesis -> AI: 13. Stream generated token chunk 1
AI -> BFF: 14. Forward stream chunk
BFF -> SPA: 15. SSE Chunk: "data: {'token': 'In'} \n\n"
SPA -> User: 16. Render word in chat window

Synthesis -> AI: 17. Stream token chunk 2...N
AI -> BFF: 18. Forward stream chunks
BFF -> SPA: 19. SSE Chunks: "data: {'token': '...'} \n\n"
SPA -> User: 20. Incremental text rendering

Synthesis -> AI: 21. Stream citations metadata & final frame
deactivate Synthesis
AI -> BFF: 22. End of Stream signal
BFF -> SPA: 23. SSE: "event: done \n\n"
SPA -> User: 24. Render citation chips and interactive graph links

@enduml
